# Kaldra Compleat: living weapon makes a Germ and attaches the Equipment to it, so the token is a 5/5 first striker with
# trample, indestructible and haste that can attack the turn it is made. Blocked by Bot2's Myr Battlesphere (4/7), it
# deals its 5 first-strike damage to it, which does not kill it, and "whenever this creature deals combat damage to a
# creature, exile that creature" exiles the Battlesphere.

